<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-GERMAN OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GERMAN OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG, Germany 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in</p>
<p>the $2.3 million German Open men's tennis tournament on Monday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>12-Sergi Bruguera (Spain) beat Scott Draper (Australia) 6-0 6-4</p>
<p>Thomas Haas (Germany) beat Dominik Hrbaty (Slovakia) 7-6 (9-7)</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Hicham Arazi (Morocco) beat 15-Jan Siemerink (Netherlands) 6-4</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>16-Michael Stich (Germany) beat Karol Kucera (Slovakia) 6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
